message: "If you use RainScope, please cite this repository and the upstream Rainform project. Reconstructed hourly values are not official observations; cite the sources in docs/DATA_SOURCES.md for the official anchors."
title: "雨境 RainScope"
abstract: "A noncommercial Three.js/WebGL visualization that turns 25 hourly rainfall values into an interactive rain scene. It is a derivative of Rainform / 数据成雨 by afterimage, with fact-anchored storm reconstructions, live-city precipitation, and a timeline."
